{
    "chapter_num": 3,
    "verses_count": 18,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Pray for Us"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Finally, brethren, pray for us, that the word of the Lord may run "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "swiftly"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and be glorified, just as "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with you, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and that we may be delivered from unreasonable and wicked men; for not all have faith."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But the Lord is faithful, who will establish you and guard "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " from the evil one. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And we have confidence in the Lord concerning you, both that you do and will do the things we command you."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now may the Lord direct your hearts into the love of God and into the patience of Christ."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Warning Against Idleness"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But we command you, brethren, in the name of our Lord Jesus Christ, that you withdraw from every brother who walks disorderly and not according to the tradition which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M they"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "he received from us. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For you yourselves know how you ought to follow us, for we were not disorderly among you; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "nor did we eat anyone’s bread "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. for nothing"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "free of charge, but worked with labor and toil night and day, that we might not be a burden to any of you, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "not because we do not have authority, but to make ourselves an example of how you should follow us."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For even when we were with you, we commanded you this: If anyone will not work, neither shall he eat. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For we hear that there are some who walk among you in a disorderly manner, not working at all, but are busybodies. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now those who are such we command and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "encourage"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "exhort through our Lord Jesus Christ that they work in quietness and eat their own bread."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "as for"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " you, brethren, do not grow weary "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " doing good. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And if anyone does not obey our word in this "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "letter"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "epistle, note that person and do not keep company with him, that he may be ashamed. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Yet do not count "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " as an enemy, but "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "warn"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "admonish "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " as a brother."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Benediction"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now may the Lord of peace Himself give you peace always in every way. The Lord "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with you all."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The salutation of Paul with my own hand, which is a sign in every "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "letter"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "epistle; so I write."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with you all. Amen."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}